  "ingredients": [
    "1 package of giblets and neck from turkey, excluding liver",
    "4 cups water",
    "1 cup turkey drippings",
    "0.5 cup cold water",
    "6 tablespoons cornstarch",
    "1 large hard-cooked egg, chopped",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WI22k5flpd7XQ8h5DMT2fEExrfg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-229958-turkey-giblet-gravy-VAT-4x3-step-01-9c6c92ce2eb14e9faefe4303d5d1ee84.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229958/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine turkey giblets, neck, and 4 cups water in a saucepan; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low and simmer until broth is reduced to 3 cups, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U0-nrhHn_n14xEFBAo_gVAaN4gA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-229958-turkey-giblet-gravy-VAT-4x3-step-02-b26c0cc29899400a84153b6ef62a80d6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229958/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strain broth and reserve 1/2 cup giblets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LVSrvtywf6F785i1eSlwIBWu5Q8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-229958-turkey-giblet-gravy-VAT-4x3-step-03-8d4c697f71bd45cc9d50e467718d3ee0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229958/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine strained broth and turkey drippings in a saucepan over medium heat. Whisk together 1/2 cup cold water and cornstarch in a small bowl until smooth; pour into broth mixture in the saucepan and bring to a boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pBeIFmZ0h5kWCx7lIAH-cteEo9w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-229958-turkey-giblet-gravy-VAT-4x3-step-04-a94d1a44d4c440dd9f603023eecec2b8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229958/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While broth is coming to a boil, finely chop giblets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PHEGoKWjJrTEWiozPY3rpr19-Jc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-229958-turkey-giblet-gravy-VAT-4x3-step-05-9bfb02b0af594956a43104c894ae2d2e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229958/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to low; stir giblets and hard-cooked egg into gravy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_DbyO72B14XCWo68zCc_feSaYsA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-229958-turkey-giblet-gravy-VAT-4x3-step-06-ce274697c1ea4a47a934f70de4318ff8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229958/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer until gravy is thickened, about 5 minutes. Season with salt and black pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/x7HuALWkUMf3YhBTiXBIKyUT58c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-229958-turkey-giblet-gravy-VAT-4x3-step-07-58c71d8c03054854929054216fc18bd5.jpg"
